   Edge: `if: >-` followed by indented continuation (ai-teammate.yml has `if: >-` with 6-space continuation lines containing `contains(github.event.issue.assignees.*.login, 'ai-teammate')) ||` — contains colons? Line: `      (github.event_name == 'issues' &&` — no colon; `       contains(github.event.issue.assignees.*.login, 'ai-teammate')) ||` — no `: ` at key position... Let me check: `contains(...)` — no colon. Good, but with scalar mode they're skipped anyway.

